### 6. CHANGE PASSWORD
### ChangePasswordRequest dùng field "confirmPassword"
### ============================================================

### USER-02 — Đổi mật khẩu thành công
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{testPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("Change password thành công", function () {
        client.assert(
            response.status === 200,
            "Expected 200, actual: " + response.status
